      "data": {
        "instruction": "Die Methode `append` hängt eine Nachricht ans Ende der Liste. Setze den Rumpf von `public void append(Message pMessage) { ... }` zusammen. Eine Zeile gehört nicht dazu.",
        "language": "java",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l1",
            "text": "ListNode tmp = new ListNode();",
            "indent": 0,
            "distractor": false
          },
          {
            "id": "l2",
            "text": "tmp.setContentObject(pMessage);",
            "indent": 0,
            "distractor": false
          },
          {
            "id": "l3",
            "text": "if (first == null) {",
            "indent": 0,
            "distractor": false
          },
          {
            "id": "l4",
            "text": "first = tmp;",
            "indent": 1,
            "distractor": false
          },
          {
            "id": "l5",
            "text": "} else {",
            "indent": 0,
            "distractor": false
          },
          {
            "id": "l6",
            "text": "last.setNextNode(tmp);",
            "indent": 1,
            "distractor": false
          },
          {
            "id": "l7",
            "text": "}",
            "indent": 0,
            "distractor": false
          },
          {
            "id": "l8",
